data: {"id": "bf802d11c6e3446e-thinking-parallel_evidence-2684", "run_id": "bf802d11c6e3446e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实、冲突与缺口\n\n### 实体身份\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh`\n- **UID**: `546ed0f3-c379-4bda-a2fe-3ffbf1b916a2`\n- **所属**: Deployment `workload` → ReplicaSet `workload-5dbb5dcd6c`\n- **节点**: `node2` (10.2.0.50)\n- **容器**: `app` (image: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`, command: `python3 -c \"import time; time.sleep(3600)\"`)\n\n### 支持候选原因的证据（ContainerCreating 的直接原因已验证）\n\n**根本原因：缺失 NetworkAttachmentDefinition**\n- Pod 的 annotation `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavaila", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1789061303180, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

